    "created_at": "2020-03-03T10:16:58Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-03-03T10:16:58Z",
    "body": "I think @elkurin wants to change that.\r\n\r\nI think the other thing we should clarify is what happens if you have multiple `SharedWorker` instances all pointing to the same thing that fails to fetch or fails to parse. The specification looks somewhat broken in how it deals with that.",
