    "created_at": "2020-03-03T13:05:59Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-03-03T13:05:59Z",
    "body": "In part it seems problematic because it's not robust. A shared worker might temporarily not have a document associated with it (although maybe it's event loop has to be frozen while that happens?). And it also doesn't seem particularly efficient to broadcast all errors. But I don't care too strongly.",
